    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d310">

                <pb facs="0729" n="685" sameAs="frus:frus1946v03/pg685"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">CFM Files</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">United States Delegation Journal</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-chapter-heading" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1946-10-06T09:30:00+01:00">October 6, 1946, 9:30 a.m.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">USDel (PC) (Journal) 63</p>
                <p>The Commission met to review the <hi rendition="#italic">Rapporteur’s</hi> report
                    to the Plenary Conference.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d310-f1"/> The report was
                    approved subject to drafting changes which might be communicated to the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Rapporteur</hi> by the members. After adoption of a
                    resolution of appreciation for the services of the Chairman, Secretariat and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Rapporteur</hi>, proposed by Mr.
                        Thorp, the Commission adjourned <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >sine die</hi>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d310-f1" n="1" xml:id="d310-f1-content">
                <p>For text of C.P.(Plen) Doc. 26, October 7, Report of the Economic Commission for
                    Italy, see <ref target="frus1946v04#pg_338">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >iv</hi>, p. 338</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
